      "message": "That\u0027s a good point, I am going to rephrase the comment to make it more descriptive.\n\nI think the workflow you described for globs in soong_build is not supported currently. soong_build is a goBinary, which is built using the compile blueprint rule. The current config (https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/+/master:build/blueprint/bootstrap/bootstrap.go;l\u003d385;drc\u003dmaster;bpv\u003d0;bpt\u003d1) enforces us to explicitly specify the source files instead of patterns (**/*.go)\n\nShould glob support be added for soong_build (and all other goBinaries) as well?",
